cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."

title: "Fabricated Ground Truth Corrupts the Score, Not the Model: Auditing and Hardening a Whole Slide Corpus for Placental Vessel Detection"

abstract: >-
  Code artifact for the MICAD 2026 paper. Contains the tiling, corpus-integrity
  and ablation pipeline (constraints C1-C5) and the archived records of the
  eight ablation runs. The whole-slide images and the derived tile corpus are
  NOT included in this repository; see README.md for how to request access.
type: software
license: MIT

